[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mPre-commit is configured to use the following tools for checking and formatting your code:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- ruff[m
[32m+[m[32m- eslint[m
[32m+[m[32m- prettier[m
[32m+[m[32m- pyupgrade[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m### CI[m
